  "title": "epan: Add a note to tvb_memcpy suggesting tvb_memdup",
  "description": "Add a note to the documentation for tvb_memcpy suggesting to use\ntvb_memdup when possible instead of allocate-then-tvb_memcpy.\nTesting that the length is available before allocation prevents\nwasted memory and cycles; in the worst case it prevents overly\nlarge allocations (based on lengths from packet data) that are\ntoo large to be present in the packet data.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
